Statement of changes (since 2026-10)
------------------------------------
- The whole application has been rewritten in Kotlin with Jetpack Compose and
  Material 3. The original Flutter/Dart sources are NOT part of this repository.
- Android-only build: minSdk 24, targetSdk 35, applicationId com.kazumi.port.
- Re-implemented modules: XPath rule engine, WebView-based video source
  resolution (native sniffing + JS injection), Media3/ExoPlayer playback,
  download manager, danmaku, WebDAV/Bangumi sync, settings (DataStore),
  and the Compose UI (popular / timeline / search / detail / player / my pages).
- Behavior and feature set are aligned with upstream Kazumi 2.3.8 where the
  Android platform allows it; platform-specific behavior may differ.

